
"smart_sources:Flora - Memory Books/115 - Injury Test and Secrets.md": {"path":"Flora - Memory Books/115 - Injury Test and Secrets.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1dti2yt","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777331019853,"size":4910,"at":1777331817893,"hash":"1dti2yt"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,24],"#115 - Injury Test and Secrets":[26,27],"#115 - Injury Test and Secrets#{1}":[27,27]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Ryan Adame projection injury test","Sealed Hall Palace of Loth Logan","Loren Claymore letter manifestation","golden thread anchor-lock technique","Charlotte sensory pain bond","vessel injury projection instability","three-second flicker vulnerability","Trial 52 Cora documentation","Howard tactical analysis","Queen Maya reaction unknown"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**Summary for Injection:**  \\n**What this is:** A specific experimental record (Trial 52) documenting the effects of physical injury to Ryan's vessel body while projected. Ryan initiated a controlled cut to test projection stability; the sensory bond transmitted full phantom pain to anchor Charlotte, causing a 3-second stabilization flicker. A knot technique (golden thread anchor-lock) prevented full collapse.  \\n\\n**When to select:**  \\n- The AI needs to recall the *tactical vulnerability* of projection during injury (3-second destabilization window).  \\n- The AI needs to know the *knot technique* as a stabilization method.\\n- The AI must track *Charlotte's sensory bond pain transmission* and Ryan's intent to suppress it.\\n- The AI should reference *Charlotte's silver ice power* remaining a secret (inner circle decision).\\n- The AI requires the *Queen Maya's observation* that anchor (Charlotte) is a secondary target.\\n- The AI processes *Loren Claymore's letter* as potential bait/intelligence and *Loren's agents* embedded in Duran's court.\\n\\n**Key relationships:** \\n- **Ryan & Charlotte:** Anchor-vessel bond; Charlotte endured phantom pain; Ryan promised to find pain toggle (query Althena). \\n- **Ryan & Estra:** Trusted cutter; Ryan swore never to ask again.\\n- **Ryan & Maya:** Refused disclosure of Charlotte's Silver powers","location":"Duran","scene_type":"investigation","character_present":["Ryan","Charlotte","Florence","Estra","Queen Maya"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/115 - Injury Test and Secrets.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"j6s5t8","at":1777331817827},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/115 - Injury Test and Secrets.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,24],"size":1938,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
